                <l xml:id="m-66691fc0-91a8-4d37-af91-6f5a3824d4bb" facs="#m-c7a27b30-90e0-41bb-9786-23900593877b" label="ambiguous">o38</l><l xml:id="m-49fbb522-19d6-4d35-8874-a97e50a8c33f" facs="#m-21f11e4c-d8f3-4cbc-91e0-24ada8b41021" label="ambiguous">Corpus Christi.</l><l xml:id="m-9fbb19fd-20e0-4c20-b425-96a0b4f19815" facs="#m-c0e49ca4-2ea0-4cf1-ada7-53301988033b" label="ambiguous">Resp.7.</l><l xml:id="m-370138a0-9403-413f-ad78-dc51c813add8" facs="#m-9dfc8c6a-75b5-467f-9209-d95d25e53e78" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-068d4864-371a-46de-a01f-cb88e6c6dd1b" facs="#m-1a680c06-c950-42d8-b437-8e2b72e0121d" label="lyrics-like">UI mandúcat“ mé¬ am cár-nem et bibit mé¬ um</l><l xml:id="m-e365e7ac-ca4a-4291-81f0-d64306142e9d" facs="#m-deb59f91-e86f-482a-b8d1-5ce374b34bec" label="lyrics-like">In me má-net, et égo</l><l xml:id="m-bb64e431-914d-406c-97a6-c97390401522" facs="#m-89ebe1e8-a58b-4253-a904-7f98452b401a" label="lyrics-like">sán¬</l><l xml:id="m-120aa80e-9da2-4487-81b9-bcf1215ffa7f" facs="#m-de780001-7107-494d-b488-2b940acae53b" label="ambiguous">guinem,</l><l xml:id="m-42df5757-be32-4d71-b11c-9618a989b870" facs="#m-a9e25a68-79e5-4741-82d5-162506f88ee3" label="lyrics-like">in é- o. V. Non est á-li-a ná¬</l><l xml:id="m-4a4ec477-8745-410e-93ba-1a5b10bf2f8e" facs="#m-f18b8532-a1b5-4e37-a566-da5c530840fd" label="lyrics-like">ti-o tam grándis, quae há- be-at dé- os appropinquán¬</l><l xml:id="m-115b668a-3f80-494c-a493-aee0b0476ff3" facs="#m-22e9fcd9-88bb-42be-9b3a-814bba65b1f7" label="lyrics-like">tes sí-bi, sic-ut Dé- us nó-ster ád-est nó-bis." In me.</l><l xml:id="m-bb46cc71-b43e-408f-9b42-2b84eb37eda1" facs="#m-6d4ad14b-71df-4eeb-bc2f-12cec6572273" label="lyrics-like">The Lector : Jube, domne, benedícere.</l><l xml:id="m-ee1c3c58-f870-4c7b-81f4-8aaa1f3d8f6e" facs="#m-a9b4fbc9-0de9-423b-9308-0852b2f773f8" label="lyrics-like">Blessing: Divínum auxilium * máneat semper nobíscum. R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-b70ae8af-ba7e-4814-b849-d15ae24f8978" facs="#m-5ffc1948-76ff-4b6e-80a2-e4e0fc038b27" label="ambiguous">Lesson VIII.</l><l xml:id="m-2316cffd-183a-4388-8161-c38cb4e7d161" facs="#m-46cb93e5-0dfa-4d9d-87e8-d12f73525106" label="lyrics-like">Ul mandúcat carnem meam, et nem, licet carnáliter et visibiliter</l><l xml:id="m-29e5c11e-7af2-4c46-b8a7-b7b04a68035b" facs="#m-188c0d4f-b93b-48a1-b855-00b64ff64a33" label="lyrics-like">Lbibit meum sánguinem, in me</l><l xml:id="m-ff61f355-1136-4db3-ae09-f0c0ce09cbb7" facs="#m-e755ff7a-928a-4113-99b2-d269e16b917e" label="lyrics-like">premat déntibus Sacraméntum cór¬</l><l xml:id="m-021c08ae-d875-4725-8419-a8da8efd7769" facs="#m-b7e05ae6-2fd8-4879-8d5f-05910ff636d9" label="lyrics-like">poris et sánguinis Christi: sed ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-e08d85f8-5bb2-4c78-8ec1-fa05f952a5dd" facs="#m-2dfcc288-52fd-4a6c-8a71-25ed664819ff" label="ambiguous">manet, et ego in illo. Hoc est ergo</l><l xml:id="m-ed7778c3-e875-426c-9598-38786346ec78" facs="#m-853c8e5c-60d8-4f17-b2a6-5d2e45754d20" label="lyrics-like">manducáre illam escam, et illum</l><l xml:id="m-952c7dfa-cbe6-45f3-91e0-9a885fdd531d" facs="#m-21ee7a0c-34d8-4811-8c4c-792c0cdfdedd" label="lyrics-like">gis tantae rei sacraméntum ad iudí¬</l><l xml:id="m-82c77875-ea29-494d-b22b-be5f81dcd479" facs="#m-a27af9cc-0868-4bfc-956c-ad971bf3cad3" label="lyrics-like">cium sibi mandúcat et bibit, quia</l><l xml:id="m-be1c64dc-bc42-4ccc-ab0c-cc1cb5cb674f" facs="#m-4a8120ad-312b-45a5-a80f-e1c6adb47424" label="lyrics-like">bibere potum, in Christo manére, et</l><l xml:id="m-b3215c8f-5860-4b5d-b202-0beea0bee2b8" facs="#m-06fd341a-c8ad-4494-8740-52087f1f0c2f" label="lyrics-like">immúndus praesúmpsit ad Christi</l><l xml:id="m-a53ffb7a-87f2-4fbb-9408-c2c8e8744335" facs="#m-7183b0c7-f0b5-498a-a8c3-a1200c36ab78" label="lyrics-like">illum manéntem in se habére. Ac</l><l xml:id="m-9376c7bf-ee73-4b17-ac25-3e719709d328" facs="#m-161e5296-7ac7-4d01-a7e9-ecf7d7112a11" label="ambiguous">per hoc, qui non manet in Christo,</l><l xml:id="m-077099ca-85d2-4ecc-a1dc-a82d961ba0af" facs="#m-30121832-c334-4f96-bb60-76a42855baaf" label="lyrics-like">accédere Sacraménta, quae áliquis</l><l xml:id="m-a0c0e37e-1cfb-40f6-bae9-0a87db01becd" facs="#m-81b71f75-2839-44b8-a215-41f47ec9e1a4" label="ambiguous">et in quo non manet Christus, pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-cdfc13bd-764e-4e4b-8a9e-cd1fff8d4ea8" facs="#m-d2f6884b-0d7d-4e94-b87e-ebc96383bcc4" label="ambiguous">non digne sumit, nisi qui mundus</l><l xml:id="m-b36d8334-0638-4e53-8eba-98810e99f1ed" facs="#m-be3a5212-dff0-464b-808b-fd99b2a1e340" label="lyrics-like">culdúbio nec mandúcat spiritáliter l est; de quibus dicitur : Beáti mundo</l><l xml:id="m-bef87ee6-81a6-4375-972d-e3e88ae143ef" facs="#m-d34fff28-b99f-46f6-89b1-5068b6a64e32" label="lyrics-like">carnem ejus, nec bibit ejus sángui-l corde, quóniam ipsi Deum vidébunt.</l><l xml:id="m-d2826bba-2879-44e2-8ae5-aaa583701eba" facs="#m-2ef82ba4-61ad-4e21-82ec-a9139157526e" label="ambiguous">Resp.8.4</l><l xml:id="m-1391c972-8599-4164-b69c-9f1caaa3fcb2" facs="#m-db493822-5a13-44fe-be9b-a946fb7c6adb" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-826499f4-7db4-44e0-b890-dfe922d8cb2d" facs="#m-f0d4928b-86a9-4e06-985b-1401a9323d59" label="lyrics-like">I sit me“ vivens Pâter,</l><l xml:id="m-90fd555a-fc17-4f3c-b785-e68384d87422" facs="#m-01fc4c3f-a8cd-44d1-8cf7-ef2e5593952f" label="lyrics-like">et é-go ví¬</l><l xml:id="m-6191bd23-4f51-48aa-afeb-6d64f3a63026" facs="#m-56a67bd5-dfed-4ed8-879b-4ce013a4a83e" label="lyrics-like">Pá- trem: “Et qui mandúcat</l><l xml:id="m-ff997918-2baf-465b-869a-0aa242ee0063" facs="#m-40662c44-a3a5-4890-b461-709f83e3ea75" label="ambiguous">vo pro¬ pter</l></lg>
            </div>
